  "notes": "おどける is an intransitive ichidan verb.\n\nASPECT (ている):\nおどけている describes someone who is currently acting silly or who characteristically clowns around.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- おどけた{顔|かお}: a comical face\n- おどけた{調子|ちょうし}: a playful tone\n- おどけて{見|み}せる: to act silly (on purpose)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\nふざける is broader, covering joking, messing around, and sometimes misbehaving. おどける focuses more on comical, clownish behavior intended to amuse.",
